ll,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5280228949005255287/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLYWxWcVFqSlJNazVOVjBkT2FsSklaSHBrTUVvMVZHdGtTMVZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5280228949005255287/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLYWxWcVFqSlJNazVOVjBkT2FsSklaSHBrTUVvMVZHdGtTMVZ1WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，感謝您撥空分享您的用餐心得，也很抱歉這次的體驗未能符合您的期待。\n\n針對您提到餐點份量與菜單照片落差的問題，我們非常重視。由於開幕初期來客數超出預期，拉麵碗一度不足，因此部分餐點暫時使用較小尺寸的餐碗盛裝，造成視覺上份量較小，讓您有與菜單照片不符的感受，這是我們需要改進的地方。目前我們已經採購新的拉麵碗，將陸續更換，以呈現更符合餐點設計的樣貌。\n\n另外，您提到雞肉份量偏少及麵體口感不佳，我們也已將您的意見轉達給廚房團隊，重新檢視出餐品質與製作流程，期望能提供更穩定的餐點品質。\n\n再次向您致歉，也謝謝您提出寶貴的建議。我們會持續改善，希望未來還有機會讓您感受到我們的進步。",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,579,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKalVqQjJRMk5NV0dOalJIZHpkMEo1VGtkS1VuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7e9d3842c6dbc9d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlJjUjB2Q2NMWGNjRHdzd0J5TkdKUnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKalVqQjJRMk5NV0dOalJIZHpkMEo1VGtkS1VuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKalVqQjJRMk5NV0dOalJIZHpkMEo1VGtkS1VuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKalVqQjJRMk5NV0dOalJIZHpkMEo1VGtkS1VuYxILMGVKbHJfcW13VUYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sSmpVakIyUTJOTVdHTmpSSGR6ZDBKNVRrZEtVbmMSCzBlSmxyX3Ftd1VGIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARnbxtLITT6QcqCzBlSmxyX3Ftd1VG\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj1hramy9KWAxUwnK8BHftbOwYQoykIQygI"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjBtbumy9KWAxWveV4EHehtLSYQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj1hramy9KWAxUwnK8BHftbOwYQ0pMFCDQoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkaVZEUnlXVmx1ZERkdU4wZFZlRVJEU25Vd1lrRRAB",["0x0:0x7e9d3842c6dbc9d",null,1784379541723496,1784379541723496,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111405145257059694603/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["queens","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-uN626gvSNjQVmfNnKHEPSvFnlt-td9qtgZ7vdwF07YorCg\u003ds120-c-rp-